ex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3HistoryTree}_S(H,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3HistoryTree}_S(H,A)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in H\">\\(h\\in H\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_h\\subseteq A\">\\(A_h\\subseteq A\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e2f76729fee1e45d\" href=\"?note=e2f76729fee1e45d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-game3-history-tree.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-game3-history-tree.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3ActionSetAtHistory}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3ActionSetAtHistory}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A^n\">\\(A^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^n\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(n\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,A)\\}\">\\(A^n\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(n\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,A)\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\">\\(|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\)</span> 仅对有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 使用；函数图见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\coloneqq h\\cup\\{\\langle\\operatorname{dom}(h),a\\rangle\\}\">\\(h^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\coloneqq h\\cup\\{\\langle\\operatorname{dom}(h),a\\rangle\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}action\\text{-}set\\text{-}at\\text{-}history} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame3ActionSetAtHistory}_S(H,A,h,A_h)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcGame3HistoryTree}_S(H,A)\\land h\\in H\\land A_h=\\{a\\in A:h^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in H\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}action\\text{-}set\\text{-}at\\text{-}history} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame3ActionSetAtHistory}_S(H,A,h,A_h)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcGame3HistoryTree}_S(H,A)\\land h\\in H\\land A_h=\\{a\\in A:h^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in H\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-game3-history-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"e2f76729fee1e45d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-game3-history-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","headin